  "instructions": [
    "Heat oil in a large pot over medium heat.",
    "Add onion and garlic; cook until softened, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add turkey neck; brown on all sides, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add tomato, broth, salt, and pepper; bring to a boil.",
    "Reduce heat to low; simmer, covered, until meat is tender, about 1 hour.",
    "Meanwhile, mix flour, baking powder, and egg in a bowl.",
    "Add melted butter; mix until a dough forms.",
    "Drop by spoonfuls onto simmering stew.",
